  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "2 tablespoons cornstarch",
    "6 cups fresh blackberries",
    "0.25 cup melted butter",
    "2.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1.5 cups white sugar",
    "1 tablespoon baking powder",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "2 cups milk",
    "0.25 cup melted unsalted butter",
    "1 tablespoon vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Rqygya0KXXDnuLkT-L0vqEUJ8-Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218009-Barons-blackberry-cobbler-ddmfs-ingredients-4x3_6556-278902fe273d4ca994885e49b903669c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218009/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Lightly grease a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OHXFRZlzrHKTBAiJCbLAn0TtbpY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218009-Barons-blackberry-cobbler-ddmfs-step01-4x3_6557-d32fc7e199a448649283d5a4b0244357.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218009/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To prepare the blackberries: Whisk sugar and cornstarch together in a small bowl. Place blackberries into a mixing bowl and drizzle with melted butter. Sprinkle cornstarch mixture over top, then toss until evenly coated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_sdt0YWH3oo7l5gVwBPIsoQCSJ0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218009-Barons-blackberry-cobbler-ddmfs-step04-4x3_6563-df7e4e278cb941bc925ca5276150272e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218009/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread blackberry mixture into the prepared baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZKYnPMCapXgZwfFx8TZPm34Mtuc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218009-Barons-blackberry-cobbler-ddmfs-step05-4x3_6565-5e1a8585835d44e79763ce83a5e93794.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218009/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the batter: Whisk flour, sugar, baking powder, and salt together in a mixing bowl until evenly blended. Stir in milk, melted butter, and vanilla until combined but still slightly lumpy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VACSIsJFV0ou6vLEMgGScYcmBTY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218009-Barons-blackberry-cobbler-ddmfs-step07-4x3_6570-57cf74b95d5d4a0ba6787f40514e6910.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218009/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour over blackberries in the baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3JZSOMiDd4CWnoJ72DIfKavSc3o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218009-Barons-blackberry-cobbler-ddmfs-step08-4x3_6572-666384ed39284c08862f70bd924e5683.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218009/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until berries are tender and the crust is golden brown, 55 to 60 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bNpVXL0TpnEctZLe2rAichCmwgw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218009-Barons-blackberry-cobbler-ddmfs-step09-4x3_6613-eebadbea730742dd8b8e3d2c1e6c2da9.jpg"
